   All source code in this repository, including the interval-based event
   query engine (ISEQL), the visual and audio pipelines, object
   re-identification, and the evaluation benchmark, was developed by and is
   released here under the Apache 2.0 license by Ghiffary Rifqialdi.

   The ISEQL+ query language and the interval-algebra operators used here are
   based on published research, which is cited in the project documentation but
   is not bundled or derived from any third-party source code:

   F. Persia, A. Dignos, S. Helmer, J. Gamper, and D. D'Auria, "Modeling and
   detecting high-level events in healthcare applications exploiting ISEQL+,"
   Soft Computing, vol. 30, no. 5, pp. 3667-3690, 2026.
   doi: 10.1007/s00500-025-10716-7
